From 19788409808c9dd3111a80adc2aeadf9e8b1269b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jasper046 <jasper046@codeofthegeeks.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:51:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] HIP: TQ2_0 MMQ (ternary unpack to Q8_0 tile, reuse q8_0
 dp4a/mma dot) + GCN per-expert J sizing (maple spike P1)

- load_tiles_tq2_0: 1 packed int -> 4 tile ints via shift/and/perm LUT, d broadcast to 8 sub-blocks
- registered in should_use_mmq, switch_type, util funcs (dp4a + mma), ds layout D4, TXS Q8_0,
  all arch configs (copied from Q1_0), mmq-instance-tq2_0.cu
- GCN: TQ2_0 MoE picks J against tokens/expert (like RDNA3/4); TQ2_0 J=16 config uses I=64
Maple pp9 167.7 -> 537, pp16 -> 842, pp512 838 -> 2407, tg128 ~200; tq2_0/q2_0/iq2_xs suites OK.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
